 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 17.7,
   "end": 19.8,
   "text": "Lay awake at night"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.0,
   "end": 22.1,
   "text": "Wondering how could I"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.2,
   "end": 24.4,
   "text": "Let it get this way"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.7,
   "end": 28.6,
   "text": "Through all the pain"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.9,
   "end": 30.8,
   "text": "I took all the blame"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.1,
   "end": 33.5,
   "text": "While you cursed my last name"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.6,
   "end": 37.8,
   "text": "I thought we could get better"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.9,
   "end": 40.0,
   "text": "Stay committed like a soldier"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.2,
   "end": 42.8,
   "text": "Believe we're okay"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.4,
   "end": 49.5,
   "text": "Now I know that you don't care"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.1,
   "end": 52.9,
   "text": "At all"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.3,
   "end": 55.1,
   "text": "Time wasted"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.1,
   "end": 57.9,
   "text": "Gave all of my soul and my heart"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.9,
   "end": 60.2,
   "text": "To someone that would never"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.2,
   "end": 62.1,
   "text": "Give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.2,
   "end": 65.8,
   "text": "I was a fool to believe that you would"
  },
  {
   "start": 66.1,
   "end": 69.0,
   "text": "Finally be the one to"
  },
  {
   "start": 69.1,
   "end": 71.0,
   "text": "Give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.1,
   "end": 74.8,
   "text": "Heartbroken now"
  },
  {
   "start": 75.4,
   "end": 79.0,
   "text": "How you let me down"
  },
  {
   "start": 79.8,
   "end": 82.0,
   "text": "But somehow"
  },
  {
   "start": 82.1,
   "end": 85.2,
   "text": "Deep down I still do"
  },
  {
   "start": 85.9,
   "end": 88.2,
   "text": "Love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.1,
   "end": 93.2,
   "text": "Now you're up all night"
  },
  {
   "start": 93.4,
   "end": 95.3,
   "text": "Telling your lies"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.4,
   "end": 97.6,
   "text": "About the way I hurt you"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.8,
   "end": 99.9,
   "text": "They couldn't see the way"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.0,
   "end": 102.2,
   "text": "You made me feel ashamed"
  },
  {
   "start": 102.3,
   "end": 104.5,
   "text": "For choosing to love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 106.7,
   "end": 108.9,
   "text": "I began to see clearer"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.0,
   "end": 111.1,
   "text": "That you were just a liar"
  },
  {
   "start": 111.3,
   "end": 113.9,
   "text": "Stuck in your ways"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.5,
   "end": 120.8,
   "text": "So now I choose to walk away"
  },
  {
   "start": 121.2,
   "end": 124.1,
   "text": "Forever"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.4,
